ot 4: stick\n\nLet me try this approach. I'll place coal in slot 1 and stick in slot 4, then craft.","type":"text"}],"type":"reasoning"},{"_meta":null,"arguments_json":"{\"code\": \"async function main() {\\n  // Try to craft a torch\\n  // Torch recipe: coal/charcoal above a stick\\n  // Grid layout (row-major):\\n  // 0 1 2\\n  // 3 4 5\\n  // 6 7 8\\n  \\n  // Place coal in slot 1 (top center)\\n  const place1 = await tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.place({ item: \\\"coal\\\", slot: 1 });\\n  console.log(\\\"After placing coal in slot 1:\\\", place1);\\n  \\n  // Place stick in slot 4 (middle center, below coal)\\n  const place2 = await tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.place({ item: \\\"stick\\\", slot: 4 });\\n  console.log(\\\"After placing stick in slot 4:\\\", place2);\\n  \\n  // Try to craft\\n  const craftResult = await tools.mcp_skillcraft_s2.craft();\\n  console.log(\\\"Craft result:\\\", craftResult);\\n  \\n  return { place1, place2, craftResult };\\n}\\n\"}","id":"4ifa4FZdu","name":"run_typescript","type":"tool_call"}],"usage":{"cache_write_tokens":0,"cached_input_tokens":6784,"input_tokens":7710,"output_tokens":841,"reasoning_tokens":572,"total_tokens":8551}},"type":"completion_succeeded"},"determinism":{"random_seed":273813694,"time_unix_ms":1795194385939},"input_id":4,"protocol_version":1},"replay_transition_sha256":"2aa0e54f0ec9a59215636af88c280efda7a84db1cc7df41652ca9ac6d3da7fd7","transition_sha256":"2aa0e54f0ec9a59215636af88c280efda7a84db1cc7df41652ca9ac6d3da7fd7","transition_shape":{"directives":["dispatch:provided_tool_call"],"next":"actions","observations":["assistant_message_committed","tool_execution_started"],"turn":"running"}},"previous_record_sha256":"e402a81b9a3790a81c3b90a093592a6be61b4722db97f589775ec583e619cb0a","record_sha256":"4d7b41b68d05556d58e87edc08123f6351e9e0ea614eda6d325728556c508e53","recovery_journal_record_version":1,"sequence":14,"type":"core_input"}
{"payload":{"delta":[{"entry":{"createdAt":1795194385939,"generationStatus":"completed","id":"reasoning-dbf7f014-52da-5ebb-865f-e25a150c2414-0","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0-1","outcome":{"type":"committed"},"relatedEntryId":null,"sessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","summary":[],"text":"Now I understand the tools:\n- `place`: Place an item from inventory into a grid slot (0-8, row-major)\n- `take`: Take an item from a grid slot back to inventory\n- `clear_grid`: Clear all items from the grid back to inventory\n- `craft`: Craft the item currently formed by the grid\n\nThe grid is 3x3, row-major:\n```\n0 1 2\n3 4 5\n6 7 8\n```\n\nIn Minecraft, a torch is crafted with:\n- 1 coal or charcoal at the top (slot 0 or 1 or 2)\n- 1 stick below it (slot 3 or 4 or 5)\n\nThe standard torch recipe is:\n```\n[coal]\n[stick]\n```\n\nWhich in a 3x3 grid would be:\n- Slot 0 or 1 or 2: coal/charcoal\n- Slot 3 or 4 or 5: stick\n\nActually, the torch recipe is just coal above a stick, so it can be:\n- Slot 0: coal, Slot 3: stick\n- Or Slot 1: coal, Slot 4: stick\n- Or Slot 2: coal, Slot 5: stick\n\nLet me try the simplest: coal in slot 0 and stick in slot 3.\n\nFirst, I need to check what's in my inventory. Let me try to place items and see what happens. Actually, I should just try to craft a torch directly.\n\nIn Minecraft, the torch recipe is:\n```\nC\nS\n```\nWhere C is coal/charcoal and S is stick, placed vertically.\n\nIn the 3x3 grid (row-major):\n- Row 0: slots 0, 1, 2\n- Row 1: slots 3, 4, 5\n- Row 2: slots 6, 7, 8\n\nSo I need:\n- coal in slot 0 (or 1 or 2)\n- stick in slot 3 (or 4 or 5, directly below the coal)\n\nLet me try: coal in slot 1 and stick in slot 4 (center column).\n\nActually, let me check the standard recipe more carefully. In a crafting table, a torch is made by placing one coal/charcoal above one stick. So in the 3x3 grid:\n\n```\n[ ] [C] [ ]\n[ ] [S] [ ]\n[ ] [ ] [ ]\n```\n\nWhere C is coal/charcoal and S is stick. This would be:\n- Slot 1: coal\n- Slot 4: stick\n\nLet me try this approach. I'll place coal in slot 1 and stick in slot 4, then craft.","turnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"reasoning","updatedAt":1795194385939},"op":"append_entry"},{"op":"set_envelope","state":{"activeCallbacks":[],"format":"harness.public-session-state/v1","history":{"cursor":{"after":null,"before":null},"entries":[],"range":"latest"},"latestTurn":{"id":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","inputEntryId":"user-turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0-1","queueItemId":null,"sessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","startedAt":1795194376379,"status":"in_progress"},"session":{"contextUsage":{"cachedInputTokens":6784,"inputTokens":7710,"outputTokens":841,"totalTokens":8551},"createdAt":1795194375885,"id":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","parentSessionId":null,"preview":"You have a crafting table available as tools (place, take, clear_grid, craft), a 3x3 grid (slots 0-8, row-major), and an inventory. Your goal: craft a torch. Use the tools to do it, then report which…","rootSessionId":"ff27578b-7c2e-25e2-16d9-a4ad5b6e00f4","status":{"activeTurnId":"turn-a20ef86fa55b9144f466741ccaa899c0","type":"running"},"title":null,"titleSource":"auto","tokenUsage":{"cachedInputTokens":14592,"inputTokens":21213,"outputTokens":1101,"totalTokens":22314},"updatedAt":1795194385939},"turnQueue":{"items":[],"maxItems":32,"paused":false}}}],"session_api":{"history_positions":{},"metadata_version":1,"next_history_index":0,"sparse_history":{"next_index":8,"positions":{"reasoning-dbf7f014-52da-5ebb-865f-e25a150c2414-0":7}},"turn_outcomes":{}},"watermark":4},"previous_record_sha256":"4d7b41b68d05556d58e87edc08123f6351e9e0ea614eda6d325728556c508e53","record_sha256":"674bff6f443742ea79de202fc3241045ebb62ab681158ce2ab5d5b69adbd66cc","recovery_journal_record_version":1,"sequence":15,"type":"projection_delta"}
